# 22-AMZ / Amazon marketplace

**Goes here.** Selling on Amazon as a whole surface. Listing creation and optimisation,
keyword indexing and ranking, images and A+ content, Amazon advertising across
Sponsored Products, Brands, Display and DSP, reviews and ratings management, Buy Box,
Brand Registry and brand protection, FBA versus FBM, fee structures, inventory limits,
account health, marketplace product research, and whether a DTC brand should be on
Amazon at all.

## Why this is a module and TikTok is not

Platform is normally a field, because a Meta hook works on TikTok with pacing
adjustments. Amazon is different in kind: a separate store, checkout, customer
relationship and economics. A Shopify product page structure does not work as an
Amazon listing. That failure to transfer is the test for a module.

## Not here

- Your own site's product page -> 07-LPG
- Paid social creative -> 10-MCR
- Google Shopping feed -> 12-GAD
- Landed cost and supplier negotiation -> 18-COG
- How the payout cycle affects working capital -> 20-FIN
- Mining Amazon reviews to find objections -> 02-AVT

**The 2 sharp lines.** Amazon's fee structure is AMZ; how a 14 day payout affects cash
is FIN. Mining Amazon reviews as research is AVT; managing your own reviews is AMZ.

