```

`mode` matters because the advice flips. A dtc_first brand asks whether to list at all
and how to protect its site. An amazon_first brand asks about rank and velocity.
Retrieving amazon_first cards for a DTC brand damages the site business, which is your
primary customer. `marketplace` matters because Amazon India is not Amazon US.

## Topics

`listing /` title and bullets, backend search terms, keyword indexing, images, A+
content, variations, listing suppression.
`ads /` Sponsored Products, Brands, Display, DSP, targeting, bids, ACoS and TACoS, ad
to organic rank.
