storage fees, returns, account health.
`strategy /` whether to list, price parity, cannibalisation, Buy Box and hijackers,
Brand Registry, review acquisition within policy, launch and velocity.

## Skip

FBA get-rich content. **Retail and online arbitrage**, which is reselling and a
different business. Dropshipping on Amazon. Review manipulation or rank gaming, which
is a policy violation and an account-ending risk.

**Tool-dependent thresholds age fast.** Marketplace research filter settings from 2023
are stale. Date everything and re-verify before a card ships.

## Scope mix

Real baseline: Brand Registry active, no suppressed listings, Buy Box won on own ASINs,
images meet category requirements, price parity policy decided.

## Priority

Your first customers sell on their own site. Amazon is what they add next.

